  "solomon_v": "The surname Solomon-V has deep historical roots originating from medieval regional records, parish registers, and early census migrations across Britain, Ireland, and Western Europe. Documented through ancient land grants and tax rolls, families bearing this name maintained distinct cultural lineages through centuries of societal shifts.",
